                                "sense_id": "7bef5812-f70c-32cf-8391-8ee943bef5b9",
                                "text": ". At this point Jansenism truly becomes synonymous with a political “movement,” and “appellancy” becomes a new form of politics, not theology, whose actual core is ambiguous apart from its notable destabilizing character."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "b9a3613a-d0fb-3bcb-ad66-6c11793d42a0",
                        "entry_id": "d6534519-b4e1-355c-8105-51db11c81db2",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A form of plea bargain in which someone is granted immunity or a reduced sentence in return for providing testimony to convict their accomplices."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
